<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu Kiden - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu Kiden - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.44		vs	   18.15</p>
<p> Operating	  425    million    vs	  385    million</p>
<p> Current	    531    million    vs	  501    million</p>
<p> Net		  238    million    vs	  227    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.93 yen	  vs	    9.49 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujitsu Kiden Ltd is a manufacturer engaged in minicomputers, ATMs and POS registers.</p>
</text>
